WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.260
CITY A – HERO ASSOCIATION HQ

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.720
Then it is decided that Mumen Rider

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.320
will remain the top-ranked class C hero.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.650
Understood. I will let him know.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.010
I simply cannot understand

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.230
why he has no desire
to move up to class B...

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:24.270
Our next agenda item is
the 55th Hero Certification Exam.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.610
For this exam,
the total number of candidates is...

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:31.250
11,684, with the exam offered
at six different venues.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.990
That is an increase of more than
22% over the previous exam.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:39.650
We mustn't be happy
with simple quantity.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:41.470
Even with more candidates,

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.960
if the quality of the heroes
is reduced,

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.130
the numbers are meaningless.

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:52.340
Therefore, we ought to be even more
critical during evaluations.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.100
Also, I hear that
a certain person of interest

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:58.560
is taking the exam this time.

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.310
Yes, it hasn't been confirmed yet,

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:05.310
but it seems very likely
that he will.

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:48.040
HERO TEST LOCATION #6

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:52.590
Candidates, please form
two lines for registration.

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:18.990
Next!
Side-to-side jumps for 30 seconds!

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:20.690
Ready...

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:22.200
Go!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:30.330
Next, the 1500-meter run. Go!

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:37.510
Next, weightlifting!

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:41.510
Next, shot put!

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.390
Vertical jumping!

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.190
Whack-a-Mole!

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:54.110
Punching machine!

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.030
I'm going home...

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:05.540
THE ULTIMATE MASTER

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.700
Finally done with all the tests.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:15.130
Now I just wait for the results.

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:19.340
Oh, you done, too?

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:20.770
Yes.

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:23.760
Hey, is there a point in you
taking fitness tests?

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:24.930
Huh?

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:29.140
I mean, can't you just give them
the data on your specs?

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:32.850
Well, whatever. So how was it?

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:37.080
Both the written and fitness tests
were far too simple.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:41.900
Right? Is that really all there is
to becoming a hero?

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.920
We should get our results soon.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.360
70 points is a passing grade.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:50.760
The written test was so easy
anyone could get full points on it.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:53.170
That just leaves the fitness test,

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:55.430
which for us should not have
posed any problems.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:58.380
— ONE HOUR LATER

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:00.340
I got 100 points.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:01.550
Seriously?

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:02.920
Yes.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:07.970
It says I'm certified as
a class S hero.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:10.430
Class S? What's that?

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:14.110
I am sure these rankings
mean little.

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:15.610
How did you do, Master?

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:17.110
Huh?

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:20.900
Oh! The letter says I'm also...

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.250
Class S.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.110
I am not surprised.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:28.160
On top of that, the font size
is bigger than mine.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:31.360
I expected nothing less, Master.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:34.520
By the way, what did they
ask you at the interview?

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:35.800
Interview?

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.290
Yes.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:41.960
Just one final question, Genos.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.930
Does this building
look familiar to you?

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:49.930
We've been secretly investigating
a group of troublemakers

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:52.680
that call themselves
the “House of Evolution.”

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:55.400
Just when we identified
its center of operations,

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:59.230
we found the building had been
mysteriously destroyed.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:03.150
And with overwhelmingly
intense firepower.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.910
Are you responsible for this?

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:10.590
I am.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.080
Why?

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.840
certified S class

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:21.710
I see...

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:22.970
I suppose it must be that

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:26.510
they felt no need to go through
the trouble of interviewing you.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:30.220
Master?

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:33.480
Yeah, after all...

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:37.980
I'm just a class C hero
with a score of 71 points.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.360
I see.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:45.530
So I mistakenly thought the top half
of the “C” was part an “S.”

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.200
Stop analyzing it!

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.170
It must be a mistake.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:51.160
I will talk to
the person in charge.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:54.080
No, don't!
You'll just embarrass me!

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:57.280
Mr. Genos, Mr. Saitama,

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:00.560
there will be a seminar for
successful candidates at 4:00 PM.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.500
Please come to lecture hall #3.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:04.930
All right, come on.

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:08.690
All that really matters
is we passed.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.050
Let's get it over with and go home.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:16.310
We finally found the cyborg
we've been looking for.

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:18.310
So I've heard.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:20.610
In consideration of
his past accomplishments,

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:24.110
we made an exception and
certified him as a Class S hero.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:28.460
I just wanted to make sure
you were notified of this.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.160
Yes, I approve.

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.660
Genos, huh?

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:41.290
Lecture Hall 3

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:44.210
First, congratulations on passing.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:50.810
Now one of you
only made it on a fluke,

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:53.150
so unless you want your luck
to go to waste,

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:55.760
I better see you
giving it your all.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:58.690
And don't get all puffed up!

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:03.780
From here on, keep your hero status
in mind and act modestly!

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:09.280
After all, your faces will be placed
on the Hero Association website.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:13.330
Did you hear me?

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:16.710
That goofball head of yours is
gonna be shown to the whole world.

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:19.200
If you don't want to
humiliate yourselves...

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.210
Aspire to be a fine hero like me!

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.300
Master!

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:40.480
As a class A hero, I have some
influence over the Association.

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.700
I'll make sure those who
behave irresponsibly...

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.020
lose points and get demoted.

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.940
Don't you forget it!

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:49.940
What should I have for dinner?

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:56.410
Apparently, the Hero Association
was formed about three years ago.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.800
So it's only been three years?

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:01.960
It was after the grandchild of
a millionaire called Agoni

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:03.760
was attacked by a monster.

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:06.750
The child was saved by a passerby.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.920
When Agoni heard
what had happened,

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.970
he came up with this system
and used his fortune

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:14.550
to establish the Hero Association.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:17.390
Well, they put on
some pretty boring seminars.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:23.840
In any case, as new heroes,
we'll be known around the world.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:27.230
Now we can work with
our heads held high.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.570
Master...

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:36.070
I guess I'm now officially
your disciple.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.850
Please continue to guide me
as my mentor.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.080
Yeah...

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:44.250
All right, Master. Good night.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.920
Yeah, see you.

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:51.140
Crap...

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:54.800
Maybe I shouldn't have been so quick
to say I'd take a disciple.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.230
Especially this guy...

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:02.480
OFFICE

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:02.410
Those two newcomers today—
did they really pass the exam?

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.350
Their attitudes were awful!

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:09.780
I'm Class A, rank 38 damn it,
and they had no idea who I was.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:12.370
Plus they don't know the first thing
about how the world works.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.110
Damn amateurs!

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:15.950
They'll be dirt-napping in no time.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:17.320
No.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:21.710
Genos got perfect scores on both
the written and physical exams.

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.160
He's a phenomenal rookie

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.590
who gained a class S ranking
right off the bat.

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:30.050
The other one, Saitama,
had terrible scores on the essay,

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:32.660
but scored a perfect 50
on the physical.

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:35.590
That's how he was able to
pass at all.

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:38.750
But in practically every activity
on the fitness exam,

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:43.560
he broke the Hero Association's test
records by inconceivable margins.

00:10:46.070 --> 00:10:50.230
It's as if there's a god
residing in that body.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:56.960
Snek, you've already been
outranked by Genos.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:00.820
And Saitama may catch up
with you soon enough.

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:05.160
That jackass?

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:11.480
If I get to the top of class C,
then I'll get promoted to class B...

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:16.670
And class A is above that,
with class S even above that...

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:20.840
I guess Genos is
actually pretty amazing.

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:25.180
I don't know...

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:29.350
...but maybe this isn't
the kind of hero I wanted to be.

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:35.450
The newcomer seminar
isn't over yet!

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:38.950
In this business, there's a thing
called rookie crushing.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:42.920
A lot of us heroes
hate to be outranked.

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:47.250
So we crush newbies early on...
like this!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.780
Hero Registry?

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:29.920
Yes, I am a class S hero and you
are a class C hero.

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:32.270
We are both ranked last
in our classes.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:36.500
Right now, we are still listed
as Genos and Saitama,

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:40.550
but as we perform more heroic acts,
we will acquire hero names.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:43.530
Hero names? What are those?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:48.920
I believe they are like nicknames
that capture a hero's characteristics.

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:51.690
For example,
I might be the “Blond Cyborg.”

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:56.360
Wait, if that's how it works,
won't I be like the “Caped Baldy?”

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:59.110
Aside from being ranked by ability,

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:01.810
you can also be
ranked by popularity.

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:04.030
There are some heroes
that have fan clubs.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:07.120
Well, no one cares about that.

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:07.700
Wha—?!

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:12.800
Thank you for agreeing to
my unreasonable request today.

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:17.290
Yeah, well I did promise
to make you my disciple...

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.570
Is right here good?

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:20.420
Yes...

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.130
So we're just having
a practice bout, right?

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.510
Not fighting for real?

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:26.640
Yes, that's what I have in mind.

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:32.270
But I want you to go all out,
so I too will give it my all.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:40.400
Please grant my request.

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:17.200
That was close...

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.860
My clothes could have got
burnt up again.

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:27.570
I need more speed!

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:52.270
He's gone?

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:55.180
Have I been chasing
his afterimage this whole time?

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:02.360
There!

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.240
Incinerate!

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:14.290
I got him this time.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.800
Master will have to take me
more seriously now...

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:18.370
Behind—

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:20.380
Okay, I win.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:26.220
Master...

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:27.380
Yah?

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:30.430
Have you forgotten
the rules of the bout?

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:34.590
Dodge any attack
you are able to dodge.

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:36.980
Take it seriously
and no fooling around.

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:38.980
Do not hold back.

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:40.190
And...

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:44.400
keep fighting until
I am no longer able to fight.

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:48.030
Even Master Saitama himself
cannot explain.

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:50.990
The secret to his power...

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:54.780
This fight may give me
some insight into it.

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:57.660
Show me no mercy.

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:04.300
Those were the rules, Master—

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:09.100
What the—?!

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:10.680
DEATH

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.410
I'm starving. Time for lunch.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.230
Let's grab some udon noodles.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.530
Okay...

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:38.370
I am prepared to do anything
in order to become stronger.

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:39.950
But...

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:43.880
I can't picture myself
even approaching Master's power.

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:47.420
Not at all...

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:54.010
He's on a different level.

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:59.060
What's the matter?
You don't like udon?

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:07.360
I see, that's his location?
Thanks, I'll head there now.

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.830
No, don't worry.

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:14.160
I'm just going to let him know
what the industry expects of him.

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:19.000
I'm glad you like udon.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:22.040
Yes, I'm not very picky.

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:25.540
Well, I'm also kinda
low on funds right now...

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:29.170
Hey, how about
another match, Genos?

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:34.890
SUPER-SPICY MEGA-MONSTER UDON CHALLENGE
PRIZE: ¥50,000, FAILURE: ¥10,000

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:36.930
That's insane!

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.300
No way!

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:43.390
I give up...

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:50.360
Is that it?

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.280
Man, you're awesome!

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:58.200
Welcome?!

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:04.460
You must be Genos.

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:08.290
I'm Amai Mask, class A rank 1.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.380
I'd like to talk to you.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.880
Class A, rank 1?

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.010
It's Amai Mask!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.840
He's so gorgeous!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:17.890
Talk?

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:20.640
He might be a rookie crusher...

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:22.520
Be careful, Genos!

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:26.350
I see. Please wait here, Master.

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:28.190
Very well.

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:31.320
I was just thinking about taking
a walk to digest my food.

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:39.540
I hear you were certified class S
by special exception.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:40.990
What of it?

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:49.380
I wonder if he's all right...

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.680
Done already?

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:01.640
Yes.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.670
You really are class S.

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:07.020
To have the top-ranked class A hero
come to personally crush you...

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:08.100
That's not it.

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:12.970
So he wasn't here to fight?
Then what gives?

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:14.480
In short...

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:16.780
He came to welcome me.

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:20.430
Huh? What's that mean?

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.830
Excuse me!

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:24.910
You're friends with
Amai Mask, right?

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.790
May I shake your hand?

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:30.960
Thank you very much!

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:32.250
Shake mine too!

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:41.340
Class S and class C heroes
sure get treated differently.

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:44.430
If you think about it, though,
isn't that like fraud money?

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:47.440
WELCOME GIFT

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:46.850
I mean, you're a cyborg, right?

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:47.860
Yes...

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:52.520
Never mind. In any case, now we're
even with a win and a loss apiece.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:56.200
Starting today
we're professional heroes.

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:58.510
Let's do our best, okay?

00:19:58.510 --> 00:19:59.530
Yes.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:07.450
A professional hero must always be
a beautiful symbol of justice.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:10.500
That is my philosophy.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.630
It's especially true
if you're a class S hero.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:17.450
Come on,
there's no need to glare at me.

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:20.340
I came all the way here
just to see you.

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:23.140
How was the Certification Exam?

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:27.060
It was nothing but rubbish.
An exam like that is a waste of time.

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:33.730
If you came to fight, get on with it.
This, too, is a waste of time.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:40.490
Being hot-blooded is fine,
but if you take it too far...

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:42.990
...you'll get burnt.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:49.860
I'll forget your criticism
of the Association.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:51.620
Thank you for your time.

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:54.130
I welcome you to the team.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:56.250
We expect great things
from you...

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:58.460
Genos.

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:11.770
Master...

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:17.480
I will be back later.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.070
Oh, okay...

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:22.530
I'll see you.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.240
Yes, goodbye.

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:55.190
A waste of time?

00:21:56.910 --> 00:21:59.440
Such an interesting fellow...

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:02.190